  "ruleText": "Mec 504.01 Fees for Other Services. Fees for a board-sponsored seminar shall be as specified in Plc 1001.17(i).\n\nSource. #10849, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13608, eff 6-11-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 504.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 500); ss by #13608, eff 6-11-23; ss by #14401, eff 10-15-25, EXPIRES 10-15-35\n\nAPPENDIX",
